layout: layouts/base.njk
title: brennan.click
---

<h1>brennan.click</h1>
<p>A wiki-linked digital commonplace book. A sister site to
  <a href="https://brennan.day">brennan.day</a>.</p>
<blockquote>
  <p>A garden is a collection of evolving ideas that aren't strictly organised by their publication date. They're
    inherently exploratory—notes are linked through contextual associations. They aren't refined or complete—notes are
    published as half-finished thoughts that will grow and evolve over time. They're less rigid, less performative, and less
    perfect than the personal websites we're used to seeing.</p>
  <cite>—
    <a href="https://maggieappleton.com/garden-history">Maggie Appleton</a>
  </cite>
</blockquote>
{% for type, sym in symbols %}
  {% set entries = collections["type_" + type] %}
  {% if entries.length %}
    <section class="type-section">
      <h2>
        <span class="sym {{ sym.class }}">{{ sym.symbol }}</span>
        {{ sym.label | capitalize }}
        {%- if entries.length != 1 %}s{% endif -%}
      </h2>
      <ul class="entry-list">
        {% for note in entries | reverse %}
          <li>
            <a href="{{ note.url }}">{{ note.data.title }}</a>
            <span class="meta">{{ note.date | dateDisplay }}</span>
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </section>
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% if not collections.notesAll.length %}
  <p>
    <em>No entries yet.</em>
  </p>
{% endif %}